  day: 2
  text: "'Ello there! We have't been introduced right? T'name's William. William
    Hammer. You've probably met my brother Edvin right? Look I know he can be difficult
    but he's a good man. Listen to him. He wants ya to do good. And he wants all
    of us to survive. But that guy Sharpe? Do not trust him. He always tries to worm
    his way into A2, only because there is less work to be done there and less minerals
    \xF6verall."
